# Raw arm reports carry a 50-item generation dump each (87 MB total). Their numbers are
# committed in the *.summary.json companions and every file is hashed in
# EVIDENCE-MANIFEST.json, so any claim in RESULTS-LOG.md can be verified without them.
# The raw files exist only on the workstation and still need a real archive.
evidence/*/pilot-*[!y].json

# Machine configuration from the run hosts, not evidence.
hosts/known_hosts_*
hosts/*.env
